    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Slahhángw kooán bal tawa mibaangw, kurkú faanqw oo xoorór Israeli kawa loohatís, bariise bahh'alé ar Israeli ina amór Esekieli keér, as nguwa yaahas daanduú gár AAKOÓ MUNGÚ i slai, nee inooín niri iwiitiyé' dír geeraaeé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng axweesantá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ana axaás, i kat, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Garmoó heewí, bariiseesír Israeli ka beer, anuú Aakoó MUNGÚ a kah, ‹Xáy, kuungá' naa hardatí'i as aníng iwa yaahasa'? Tí ar ló', adoodá' anuú Aakoó MUNGÚ nir hotaatima, aníng yaahasarhúng a baloó ya/amaaká.›",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Heewí, kuúng taa amohhe'ési mukwí kuwa sakwasleemut? Gimáy sakwasleemuuteek. Bariiseerí ka inslawtís daanduú tidá' aa tlehhi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ki beer, anuú Aakoó MUNGÚ a kah, ‹Baldá' múk Israeli nguwa tsawaár, xwaylár Yakobo ana lo'ór wa /aáy. Tina geehhooatís dir'ín i aleeró qoomár tawa baraá yaamaá Misri, lo'o ana /aáy, ana oó', Aníng a AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng.› ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baldá' lo'o ngiwa /aáy ina báw, ‹Aníng kuungá' nu duúx yaamaá Misrír wa alé nee nuri geerahaár ay baraá yaamaá naa kuungá' i tsawaár, yaamaá ilwa nee dane, yaamaá ak hhoohhoo' ta yaamaá hatlá' sleémeero.› ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ina báw, ‹Muruudá' aníng ni ahhiit sleémeero kuungá' ta sla'a', kwahhaak amór saaw. Miti meetagamisaara' ar slaqsa'aá munguaá hatlá' awa Misri, asma aníng a AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng.› ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala ina aahhiyé', slám iga iiaárií qaasi'iiká. Tam heé wák i kaahh oo muruudá' aníng ni ahhiit, kudá' inooín i slaiya', gwaa may tlehhtuuwo, sleeme inooín slaqsi'iidaá munguaá yaamaá Misri ngaa may'iiká. Naagáy niri oó', ‹In i buúhh dír ir baraá yaamaá Misrír i kahhiya'.› ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala aníng adoorí tleehhamooro ana máw as ilaiwa/amér umuueé', as kahhó' mukuwa waaqaqaá' nee xoorduudá' nee inooín alhootá', kudá' ngaa ariye', aníng tiwa xu'utís ngiwa duúx baraá yaamaá Misrír wa alé.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Naagáy aníng ina duúx baraá yaamaá Misrír wa alé ngiri huúw baraá xaanxaay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ina kaahir'eéní i haniís ngiri intsaahhatís daber'eene, tidá' handá' hee birnga eehár in hoot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ina Sabaátor'eéní haniís as tawa laya tla/ángw án nee inooine, ngiwa xuiya' adór aníng tar AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, kudá' inooín gi hhohhoeemiís. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala múk Israeli ina dee/anuút baraá xaanxáy wa ale, kaahir'eé' eeharto ngina si'iyé' nee daber'eene, tidá' handá' hee geeraawo birnga eehár, in hoot. Deelór Sabaáto ngaa meetagaasiyé'. Aníng niri oó', In i buúhh ngiri hhaamiís baraá xaanxaay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala aníng tina kilooeé' ilaa/, as ilaiwa/amér umuueé' makawa waaqaá' nee xoorduudá' ngaa ariye', qoomár inooín ngiwa duúx baraá yaamaá Misrír wa aleeró. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tam adoorihe aníng lo'o ana huúw baraá xaanxáy wa ale niwa káh, ‹I dahiaaká baraá yaamuudá' naa inooín i haniís, yaamaá dane nee ilwa, yaamaá ló'wa hhoohhoo' ta yaamu sleémeerowo.› ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adoorí ana tleéhh asma inooín daber'eé' ngina si'íyé', nee naa hooti'iiká ar baraá kaahir'eé', Sabaátor'eé' ngina meetagaasiyé', asma inooín slaqsi'iidaá munguaá hatlá' ngina gurií ba/iyé'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Ala aníng ina meetiís, iga qwaareesiiká baraadaá xaanxáy ale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na/ii'ín ina naanaáq baraá xaanxáy wa alé, ina báw, ‹Slooír baabi'iihúng ma eeharaara', tam hara'ayar'ín ma oohara', laqaá miti slasla/areesara' ar slaqsi'iidaá munguaá hatlá'.› ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ an Munguúhúng, kaahir'eé' na eeharaak, nee daber'eé' na harmagahhaak ooharo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee Sabaáto na hhoohhooeesaak as tawa layár alqador'eé' tla/ángw án nee kuungá'. Sabaátorí kuungá' nun inslawtís adór aníng tar AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Ala tam na/ii'ín sleeme aníng ina aahhiyé', naa baraá kaahir'eénár hooti'iiká, sleeme daber'eé' ngaa harmagahhi'iiká ooharo, nee Sabaátor'eé' ngina meetagaasiyé'. Naagáy nari oó', ‹In i buúhh, tidá' tleehhamooro ni slaa' daanduuine ngiri boo/eés baraá xaanxáy wa alé.› ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala aníng dakw'eé' una ilaá/ as ilaiwa/amér umuueé', makawa waaqaá' nee xoorduudá' inooín ngaa ariye', qoomár ngiwa duxuum baraá yaamaá Misrír wa aleeró. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tam adoorihe lo'o ana huúw baraadaá xaanxáy wa alé niwa kah, alók geeraawo ina huúw ay yaamaá saaw, tawa hotaá ay tla/ángw xoordaá inooín ni xuiaaká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma inooín daber'eé' ngaa eehar'iiká, nee kaahir'eé' ngina si'iyé', nee Sabaátor'eé' ngiri meetagaasiyé', nee slaqsi'iidaá munguaá hatlá' kudaá baabi'ii'ín naa harahhifiyé', inooín ngina harahhifiyé'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
