            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Slám kaahír tlakw tidá' hee birnga eehár iwa gwaai ana haniís. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng ina máw as na/ii'ín awa baris ngiwa hanmiisiya' ilahhooár wa ale, dír slaqsi'iidaá munguaá hatlá'. Gaarí an slahhtaín ar dae tlaaq, as aníng iwa tsaahhiya' adór tar AAKOÓ MUNGÚ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Hám daxta heewí, múk Israeli baweek, aníng Aakoó MUNGÚ a kah, ‹Baabi'iihúng ina /oosliisliné', asma nina iiawasleesiyé' dir'eene.› ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma qoomár ngiwa huúw baraá yaamuudá' naa inooín i alqadiím ngiwa haniis, umuúqo tloomár tleere ngiwa ariyé', laqaá xa'anoó loo/ór naa/ koóm, inooín nguna ilahhooárií gaasiyé' as aníng iwa hayloórí leehhiya', amooqaáqae ta ilahhooár mooyángw tsuú' hanmiis nee ar tsipipi'iimisuuwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng ngiri báw, ‹Wa/ameedá' gawaá gongoamo ta kakeera' ma baabeerá'?› Umuuwós kuri báy Bama tam ay laarí. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe múk Israeli kubeeto, ‹Anuú Aakoó MUNGÚ nu yaahamiís, xáy, kuungá' slooír baabi'iihúng ana otí'iíke as tiwa meetagaamisa', nee muruú aníng i buhhtamís kuwa sluufmisa'.› ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barnaxes kuungá' aga kumité' ilahhooa hanmisuwo, nee na/iihúng kiwa da/a/aanda' ar asla, tin meetagaamisá' tam ay laarí. Xáy, kuungá' aníng iqo gurbu'útí lehhá'a, kuungaákaá múk Israeli? Ala anuú Aakoó MUNGÚ adoodá' nir hotaatima, lo'o aga /aáy, aníng a ya/aamaaká iwa gurbu'útí lehha'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuungaáká' kaahá', ‹Atén a adór xoordaá hatlá' tleehhitaán, nee tlahh'aá yaamaá hatlá', as xaai nee tlaa/e kiwa sluufmisaan.› Tisíng ta baraá munerhúng i kata' i baloó ya/aandaaká.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Adoodá' aníng nir hotaatima, anuú Aakoó MUNGÚ lo'o aga /aáy, ana oó', ‹Aníng kuungá' nu sawaawuti'iím ar dakw'eé' oo ló'wa /uuruú koóm ar xarasleema, nee nuri i buúhh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng kuungá' nun duúx baraá xoordaá hatlá' wa aleeró, nee nuri burumbuúr baraá yaamuudá' nuy diyaa/i, ar dakw'eé' oo ló'wa /uuruú koóm, ar xarasleema nee buhhtaeé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng kuungá' nu huúw baraá xaanxoó xoordu, nee amoodae nuri sakwasleemuút. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adoodá' baabi'iihúng ngira sakwasleemuút baraá yaamaá Misrír wa aleeró, an adoodá' aníng kuungá' nur sakwasleemuut.› Anuú Aakoó MUNGÚ tí aga oó'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Aníng kuungá' nun ildá/, as tawa ya/aanda' de'engw'eene nee alqador'eé' kawa ilaiwawa/a'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk aa dee/anumiit nee kudá' aníng i sadakumiís u hingeés baraá tla/angwhunge, i hingeés baraá yaamuudá' i hootia, tari adór múk aa goow, ala i dahiaaká baraá yaamaá múk Israeliwo. Diirí an didá' kawa tsahha' adór aníng tar AAKOÓ MUNGÚ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Hám daxta kuungaá múk Israeli, anuú Aakoó MUNGÚ nun babaw, ‹Án bir iialooeemisa'aaká, kár ala gimsé', kumité' munguaá hatlá' sluufmisuuwo, ala tundun /uurutis umuueé' kudá' hhoohhoó' kuwa meera' /osliisliingo ar ilahhooa nee slaqsi'iihúng kudaá munguaá hatlá' kudá' ta haratlintaatia'.› ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma aníng gawaá tloomar'eé' tidá' hhoohhooe, tidá' tleraantleer ar yaamaá Israeli, aníng Aakoó MUNGÚ a kah, Kuungá' sleémeero awa múk Israeli in didá' wa sagadiyusá'. Amoodaádae aníng kuungá' nu ilaaóh, nee nuri daám iwa ilahhooár i huba', nee ilahhooár hhohho' tidá' taa tsawdé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala barna duúx baraá yaamuudá' tay diyaá/ nuri dinkwaárií burumbuúr, ilahhooarhúng tidá' mooyaangw tsuú' a ilaaóh. Aníng hhohhoaarir'eé' ngiri geehhooatís tla/angwhúng wa alé dír geeraá xoorór hatlá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuungá' aníng daqaní i tsahhá' adór tar AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, qoomár burna huúw ay baraá yaamaá múk Israeli, yaamaá naa qaroó lo'ór wa /aáy ngiwa haniis dír baabi'iihúng. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Didaádá' an dír tlakweemahúng nee tlehhmi'iihúng kudá' tlakw kiwa insleera', adór kuungá' nura slasla/areesiyé'. Kuungá' mune nuri fák as tlakweemahúng kudá' taa tlehhé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kari tsahhá' adór aníng tar AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, qoomár burna adór harimaaká i tleéhh, adór alqoomaaká nee tlehhmi'iihúng kudá' tlakw, ala adór ilaiwa/amér umuueé'. Anuú Aakoó MUNGÚ tí aga oó'.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
